sequenceDiagram
  actor A as Admin
  participant R as AdminRoute
  participant G as ForumGovernanceService
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  A->>R: PATCH /admin/forum/reports/:id
  R->>R: 校验 action/adminNote/penaltyScore
  R->>G: reviewForumReport(input)
  G->>DB: 开启事务并读取举报单
  G->>DB: 更新 forum_reports.status
  alt action = approve
    G->>DB: 软删除帖子或评论
    G->>DB: 扣除 users.credit_score
    G->>DB: 写 credit_score_logs
    G->>DB: 清理同目标 pending 举报
  end
  G-->>R: 返回审核结果
  R->>DB: 写 audit_logs
  R-->>A: 审核完成
